e has done this will the bishop take action against the creatures, to end their threat to the population of Castile... and Christianity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325200/extras/06720e09192aa36161b2f3dfadd6e9ae.poster.avif?t=1752346533\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325200/extras/06720e09192aa36161b2f3dfadd6e9ae.webm?t=1752346533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325200/extras/06720e09192aa36161b2f3dfadd6e9ae.mp4?t=1752346533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325200/extras/d9bfaf54e5ac6b7d65b14a811f537ec7.avif?t=1752346533\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lateral logic puzzles, with a smooth difficulty curve </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No dead-ends or deaths, just fun! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Female main character </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic frame-by-frame animation, with lip syncing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An original story full of fantasy, humor and plenty of Spanish folk legends and myths to discover </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Occasional references to the adventure game classics, without going overboard! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inspired by classic adventures like Monkey Island and Broken Sword </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More than 30 characters and mythological creatures to interact with </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Around 50 picturesque scenes, each hand-drawn with pencil and paper, and digitally colored in full HD resolution </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hundreds of objects to inspect, combine and use </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No slider/jigsaw/mechanical puzzles (guaranteed!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One-button interface with 3 contextual verbs, providing more room for experimentation and fun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original soundtrack, plus traditional pieces of Castilian folk music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325200/extras/a7faa3aa79f54ec9a7f571add866b882.poster.avif?t=1752346533\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325200/extras/a7faa3aa79f54ec9a7f571add866b882.webm?t=1752346533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325200/extras/a7faa3aa79f54ec9a7f571add866b882.mp4?t=1752346533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
